    id: "2026-06-dalio-ai-bubble-burst",
    title: "Bridgewater's Ray Dalio: AI is a real technology, but the bubble will eventually burst — sentiment is already nearing 2000 and 1929 levels; US debt has passed the 'point of no return,' and the most fragile window is after the midterms",
    channel: "Bloomberg",
    videoTitle: "AI Bubble Will Burst Eventually, Says Bridgewater's Ray Dalio",
    url: "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Ray+Dalio+AI+bubble+will+burst+Bridgewater",
